ind":"update","title":"FIND ALIEN! Demo v0.0.3 UPDATE","summary":"Hello, everyone! We've released a new update to make your gameplay experience smoother and more enjoyable!This patch focuses on improving overall gameplay stability, refining throwable item mechanics, and making important in-game information easier to spot. Check out the details below! Key Updates & Improvements - Background Optimization for a Smoother ExperienceWe've added an in-game monitoring system to help improve game balance and stability. The data collected will help us deliver more excit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:55:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034797","verified_at":"2026-10-23T06:33:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3686720-1846651706691360","game_id":"steam-3686720","kind":"announcement","title":"FIND ALIEN! – Steam Next Fest 2026!","summary":"FIND ALIEN! is joining Steam Next Fest (October 19–26)!Hello, everyone! We're Team Newmatic! Haven't tried FIND ALIEN! yet? Disguise yourself as a human, sneak past B.A.R.D. agents, solve puzzles with friends, and rescue the captured Tumai!The free demo is available now on Steam!Take on the challenge solo or team up with up to 3 friends for some co-op fun! We'd love to hear what you think! Whether it's something you enjoyed, something that could be improved, or a new idea, feel free to share it ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3686720-1846651706680444","game_id":"steam-3686720","kind":"update","title":"FIND ALIEN! Demo v0.0.2 Hotfix","summary":"Hello, everyone! This is Team Newmatic. Thank you for playing the FIND ALIEN! demo. In this v0.0.2 hotfix, we’ve added a quality-of-life UI for a more comfortable play experience, along with fixes for several confirmed issues.UpdateRescued Alien UI added: You can now check your rescued alien progress at a glance in the top left of the screen.FixDemo end screen: Fixed an issue where the demo end UI did not appear properly for clients after clearing all demo stages.Character freezing: Fixed an iss","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680444","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3686720-1846651706677759","game_id":"steam-3686720","kind":"announcement","title":"FIND ALIEN! – Demo Out Now!!","summary":"FIND ALIEN! – Rescue Your Teammates! FIND ALIEN! is a cooperative stealth action game for up to 4 players. You're an alien! Disguise yourself as a human and sneak into a heavily guarded facility while avoiding the watchful eyes of B.A.R.D. agents! Team up with your friends, solve various puzzles, and rescue your captured fellow aliens, the Tumai! Key FeaturesPlay Together! Play solo or team up with friends in online co-op for up to 4 players.Perfect Disguise! Copy the appearance of nearby humans","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:37:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3686720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3686720":"2026-10-26T10:58:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"368